  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>On rue du Port, at the far end of Cavalaire-sur-Mer harbour, there's an iClean DogWash BASIC cabin: a self-service dog washing station installed under a small wooden shelter, near the area where motorhome parking is banned by prefectural order. The cabin is fitted with an access ramp and a stainless steel wash tub.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>This listing was fully verified on site by the user, photos taken — a higher level of confidence than a simple written source. The station is open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. The base programme costs €12 for 20 minutes, payable in coins or by card on a Nayax terminal (no change given). The sequence runs step by step, selected on the control panel: shampoo (2-4 min), rinse (1-2 min), conditioner (1-2 min), anti-parasite product eliminating fleas and ticks (30 sec-1 min), then warm drying, gentle or strong (5 min each). Drying and disinfecting the cabin after use are included in the programme. You can extend the time by adding €1, €2 or €3 at the end of the programme. A number is displayed in case of malfunction (06 27 41 75 87).</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: secure your dog with the safety leash provided on the platform before starting the payment — the instructions displayed on site remind you of this in both French and English.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Cavalaire harbour gives access to the town-centre beaches and, a little further on, to the Bay of Cavalaire and the start of the coastal path towards Le Rayol-Canadel.</p>
    </div>

